   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Plural Accusative in Reading",
   "texto": [
    "With inanimate objects in plural, the accusative coincides with the nominee: яблоки, книги, газеты.",
    "With people, the plural accuative coincides with the plural genitive: друзья → друзей, соседи → соседей, дети → детей.",
    "Помогать governs dative: помогаем им («We helped them.»). Любить has direct object: любим детей."
   ]
